IgnoreLayoutTip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/DetailCustomization/DreamWidgetCustomization.cpp
    src   "Opt this widget out of its parent layout's arrangement: the panel will neither position nor size it (its authored anchors apply), and panels that arrange content — including Scroll Box — will skip it entirely. Leftover from the old UIScrollView content workflow on many widgets; clear it unless you really mean it."
    text  "使此控件脱离其父级布局的排列：面板既不会定位也不会调整其大小（其定义的锚点生效），并且包含滚动框在内的排列内容的面板将完全跳过它。这是许多控件上旧的 UIScrollView 内容工作流程的遗留物；除非您确实需要它，否则请清除它。"
    state machine
}

